This is a complete overhaul of the Hyper-S

Removed:
1. Mixware v2.2 circuit board
2. Break out boards x2
3. Ribbon Cables x2
4. X, Y and Z endstops
5. Outdated Marlin v2.0
6. Touch screen

Added:
1. BTT Octopus v1.1
2. Klipper
3. Sensorless homing X and Y
4. Probe Z Endstop
5. Higher amperage X, Y and Z 
